    "detailed_description": "Dragons Eye Studio brings you into the mythical world of Tearstone with the <strong>mind-bending adventure</strong>, Tearstone: Thieves of the Heart! <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945750/extras/01fd4bf71b203840653124620b7c9e81.avif?t=1697721566\" /></div><br>The Heart of Tearstone has gone missing! Ten years have passed since your last journey into this strange world, and with the Heart\u2019s disappearance, powerful sorcery has taken hold! With few clues to follow, your quirky troop of friends has summoned you to help solve a growing mystery and save the inhabitants of Tearstone! <br>Who took the Heart? What secrets does it contain? \u2026 And is this airship actually safe?<br>There\u2019s only one way to find out! Climb aboard and hold on tight for a challenging and enchanting Adventure game for the ages!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945750/extras/5a6b1e48d34e1fbdf3d6ea9d117e1975.poster.avif?t=1697721566\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945750/extras/5a6b1e48d34e1fbdf3d6ea9d117e1975.webm?t=1697721566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945750/extras/5a6b1e48d34e1fbdf3d6ea9d117e1975.mp4?t=1697721566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Features<br>\u2022 Original mini-games and puzzles<br>\u2022 Most unique hidden-object scenes<br>\u2022 Beautiful, hand-painted locations<br>\u2022 Intriguing characters<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945750/extras/c5f58d5c9f9e45d40ff6dd5e43358ea0.poster.avif?t=1697721566\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945750/extras/c5f58d5c9f9e45d40ff6dd5e43358ea0.webm?t=1697721566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945750/extras/c5f58d5c9f9e45d40ff6dd5e43358ea0.mp4?t=1697721566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>This is a special Collector's Edition release full of exclusive extras:<br>\u2022 Challenge yourself even more with an incredible <strong>Bonus Chapter: Portal Todd</strong>!<br>\u2022 <strong>7 Cards of Destiny</strong> - secret Bonus Game!<br>\u2022 An integrated strategy guide.<br>\u2022 Dozens of achievements and collectibles!<br>\u2022 Wallpapers, concept art, soundtracks and movies. <br>\u2022 Replay favorite mini-games and puzzles!",
    "about_the_game": "Dragons Eye Studio brings you into the mythical world of Tearstone with the <strong>mind-bending adventure</strong>, Tearstone: Thieves of the Heart! <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945750/extras/01fd4bf71b203840653124620b7c9e81.avif?t=1697721566\" /></div><br>The Heart of Tearstone has gone missing! Ten years have passed since your last journey into this strange world, and with the Heart\u2019s disappearance, powerful sorcery has taken hold! With few clues to follow, your quirky troop of friends has summoned you to help solve a growing mystery and save the inhabitants of Tearstone! <br>Who took the Heart? What secrets does it contain? \u2026 And is this airship actually safe?<br>There\u2019s only one way to find out! Climb aboard and hold on tight for a challenging and enchanting Adventure game for the ages!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945750/extras/5a6b1e48d34e1fbdf3d6ea9d117e1975.poster.avif?t=1697721566\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945750/extras/5a6b1e48d34e1fbdf3d6ea9d117e1975.webm?t=1697721566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945750/extras/5a6b1e48d34e1fbdf3d6ea9d117e1975.mp4?t=1697721566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Features<br>\u2022 Original mini-games and puzzles<br>\u2022 Most unique hidden-object scenes<br>\u2022 Beautiful, hand-painted locations<br>\u2022 Intriguing characters<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945750/extras/c5f58d5c9f9e45d40ff6dd5e43358ea0.poster.avif?t=1697721566\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.stea